ocation":{"lat":-8.65667,"lng":115.21889},"visitMinutes":45,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"denpasar_pura_agung_jagatnatha_kota_denpasar","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":0,"commonsNearby":16,"wikidataSitelinks":2,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-25"},"hashtags":["puraagungjagatnathakotadenpasar","denpasar"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"},{"open":"09:00","close":"18:00"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"summary":"A state temple which was built in 1953. Dedicated to the supreme being Sanghyang Widi Wasa, this temple is open to all worshipers without any restriction as it is a government building and not a village temple. 15-30 min visit. There are large ceremonies here twice a month at full moon and dark moon. Ask at the tourist office for a detailed schedule.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Denpasar","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/Pura_Jagatnatha_in_Bali%3B_David_Stanley%3B_November_2011.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/Pura_Jagatnatha_in_Bali%3B_David_Stanley%3B_November_2011.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"David Stanley from Nanaimo, Canada","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pura_Jagatnatha_in_Bali;_David_Stanley;_November_2011.jpg"}},{"id":"denpasar_wv_alun_alun_puputan","areaId":"denpasar","name":"Alun-Alun Puputan","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":-8.65714,"lng":115.21767},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"denpasar_wv_alun_alun_puputan","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":18,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-25"},"hashtags":["alunalunpuputan","denpasar"],"summary":"The huge four-faced, eight-armed Catur Mukha statue is situated here at the centre point of the city (Jl Gajah Mada/Jl Suprati). Representing the Lord Brahma and it serves as a guardian of each cardinal point. The square is a key point of orientation for the whole city. If you get lost, find your way back here and all will be clear. Often, locals play kite in the day and evening.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Denpasar","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Panggung_Baleganjur.jpg/1280px-Panggung_Baleganjur.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/62/Panggung_Baleganjur.jpg/500px-Panggung_Baleganjur.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Herryz","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Panggung_Baleganjur.jpg"}},{"id":"denpasar_wv_taman_wedhi_budaya_cultural_centre","areaId":"denpasar","name":"Taman Wedhi Budaya Cultural Centre","category":"museum","tags":["museums"],"location":{"lat":-8.656,"lng":115.2339},"visitMinutes":120,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"denpasar_wv_taman_wedhi_budaya_cultural_centre","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsNearby":6,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-25"},"hashtags":["tamanwedhibudayaculturalcentre","denpasar"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"08:00","close":"15:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"15:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"15:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"15:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"15:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"15:30"},{"open":"08:00","close":"15:30"}]},"summary":"A museum that covers the history and essence of Balinese art. The classical schools are well represented by both paintings and sculpture and there is a large section featuring contemporary Balinese art. Gamelan orchestra performances are also held.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Denpasar","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/Garuda_-_panoramio_-_Art_Anderson_%281%29.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/